---@field searchInformation? gcp.customsearch_v1.SearchSearchInformation Metadata about a search operation.
---@field items? gcp.customsearch_v1.ResultList The current set of custom search results.
---@field queries? gcp.customsearch_v1.SearchQueries Query metadata for the previous, current, and next pages of results.
---@field kind? string Unique identifier for the type of current object. For this API, it is customsearch#search.

